 "type": "game",
 "name": "Kimbap Heaven Simulator",
 "steam_appid": 4206910,
 "required_age": 0,
 "is_free": false,
 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>你知道“紫菜包饭天堂”吗？</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/619b901520df0a57076fa214d877961c.avif?t=1788396786\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在 <strong>&lt;Kimbap Heaven Simulator&gt;</strong> 中，成为韩国最受欢迎的餐厅老板吧！“Kimbap Heaven”几乎遍布韩国的每个街区，为人们提供紫菜包饭以及各种大家喜爱的韩国料理。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >现在，轮到你经营一家了！亲身体验紫菜包饭餐厅老板真实的一天——认真准备新鲜食材，同时应对源源不断涌来的顾客订单。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>从头到尾亲手烹饪</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/bbd64f68e569fa10c7f7539c5a4b7421.poster.avif?t=1788396786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/bbd64f68e569fa10c7f7539c5a4b7421.webm?t=1788396786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/bbd64f68e569fa10c7f7539c5a4b7421.mp4?t=1788396786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >购买真正的海苔，准备好卷帘，洗米、煮饭。切腌萝卜、炒胡萝卜、焯菠菜，再煎好鸡蛋。将所有食材铺在海苔上，紧紧卷起，然后切成大小完美的紫菜包饭。最后，把它端给顾客吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一个步骤都很重要。把食物烧焦，就会浪费宝贵的食材。让顾客等待太久，他们就会生气。但如果每一道料理都做得完美无缺？好评自然会接踵而来！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>经营、成长并扩大你的餐厅</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/4710815c304f5ddaf148a4eb5cf04534.poster.avif?t=1788396786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/4710815c304f5ddaf148a4eb5cf04534.webm?t=1788396786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/4710815c304f5ddaf148a4eb5cf04534.mp4?t=1788396786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过食材订购终端购买原料，并合理管理库存。买得太多，食材会变质；买得太少，又可能在营业途中断货。通过美味的料理赢得顾客的真实评价和星级评分，不断提升餐厅的声誉。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >吸引更多顾客，打造专业又令人印象深刻的店内环境，并维持良好的声誉，即可提升店铺等级。达到更高等级后，还能解锁更多料理。从最基础的紫菜包饭开始，逐步解锁金枪鱼紫菜包饭、拉面、韩式炸猪排和炒饭。购买更好的厨房设备，升级你的餐厅并提高工作效率，打造属于你的终极紫菜包饭天堂！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >主要特色</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>完整的 Kimbap Heaven 经营体验</strong> – 从购买食材、烹饪、上菜到餐厅管理全部亲手完成</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>真实的韩国料理模拟</strong> – 像现实中一样处理并烹饪各种食材</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>可解锁的新食材</strong> – 随着等级提升不断扩充菜单</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>正宗的紫菜包饭食谱</strong> – 在游玩的同时学习真正的制作方法</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>精美还原的韩国街景</strong> – 沉浸在充满韩国文化气息的街道与风景之中</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……以及<strong>隐藏其中的神秘秘密</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/bf4716cfc45f830ea93e22f5f116d186.poster.avif?t=1788396786\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/bf4716cfc45f830ea93e22f5f116d186.webm?t=1788396786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4206910/extras/bf4716cfc45f830ea93e22f5f116d186.mp4?t=1788396786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>准备好升入天堂了吗？</strong></p>",
